144
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:42,320
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

145
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,160
Hello?

146
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:16,960
Hey, are you up? What are you doing?

147
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,760
What's up, Roch?

148
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,880
I'm calling about your brother.

149
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,560
My brother?

150
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,240
Yeah, Nontawat.

151
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,680
He interviewed for a job at RC.

152
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:34,520
Did he tell you?

153
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:36,440
Not yet.

154
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,440
Huh?

155
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,680
What's going on with you two brothers?

156
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,840
We don't really talk about personal stuff.

157
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,040
The reason I called is

158
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,520
I just wanted to say

159
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:50,800
your brother is like my own brother.

160
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:53,400
So you don't have to worry.

161
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:56,760
I trust you will decide what's appropriate.

162
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,200
Nont applied for a job at RC.

163
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,680
What was he thinking?

164
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,920
We haven't run together lately.

165
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:35,720
I'm saving my energy to focus on work.

166
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:38,160
You're so disciplined.

167
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,600
Gotta hand it to you.

168
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,080
Black coffee.

169
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,480
Welcome back to fasting.

170
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,120
Don't go telling my mom.

171
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,840
I'm not your mom's spy.

172
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,920
Really?

173
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,480
Not going anywhere today?

174
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:08,960
The company I interviewed with gave me
a trial assignment to prepare a presentation.

175
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,160
I'm gonna work on it here.

176
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:12,560
What company? Maybe I know it.

177
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,840
It's a marketing company.

178
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:17,960
I don't wanna tell you yet.

179
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,920
I want to prove myself first.

180
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:21,520
If I get the job, I'll tell you.

181
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,280
You don't trust me?

182
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,440
It's not that, Kit.

183
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,840
I just...

184
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,360
don't want you to worry.

185
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,920
Who told you to think that way?

186
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:36,720
You're my brother. Of course I'll support you.

187
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,600
Really?

188
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,320
Why?

189
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,680
Or do you want me to tell you, "Go for it!"?

190
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:53,360
If you really mean that,
I'm even more motivated to work.

191
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,640
But I'm telling you,

192
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:58,800
I haven't given up on
the idea of you going to grad school.

193
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:02,920
While you're looking for a job,
I'll do more research.

194
00:13:03,280 --> 00:13:05,440
Then we'll see which option is better.

195
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,040
Deal?

196
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,200
Deal.

197
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:14,160
You might need some personal space
to work for a while.

198
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,320
Use the spare bedroom.

199
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:19,920
Let me know if you need any equipment.
I'll get Sharp on it.

200
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,120
Mm.

201
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,240
That sounds good.

202
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,240
Then the spare room won't go to waste.

203
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:29,760
I'll go shower and get dressed.

204
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,280
Time for work.

205
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:31,920
Okay.

206
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:33,600
Kit.

207
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,280
Go for it!

208
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,720
Are you making fun of me?

209
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,120
You'll regret it.

210
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:54,880
I know Kit's upset that I didn't listen to him.

211
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:58,280
I hope that by doing this,

212
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,880
he'll see me as more than

213
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,600
just his little brother.

214
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,920
Nont took off his ring.

215
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,640
He didn't tell me about the job.

216
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,680
That's perfectly normal.

217
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,360
But...

218
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,760
why doesn't it feel normal to me?

219
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:17,560
♪ I've heard a thousand stories ♪

220
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:21,360
♪ But it never crossed my mind ♪

221
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,680
"Just reheat and enjoy.

222
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,640
I'm stuck in an online meeting."

223
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:29,880
♪ That my heart couldn't take
A world where you're not around ♪

224
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:41,200
♪ 'Cause I'm so sure that you're my world ♪

225
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:49,720
♪ I need you to know that ♪

226
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:54,320
♪ After all the ups and downs we've been through ♪

227
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:58,560
♪ I know it with my heart, my soul and mind ♪

228
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:04,720
♪ That through it all
I'll always be right with you ♪

229
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:09,680
♪ Know that I'm yours for life ♪

230
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:17,280
♪ Every time I look into your eyes ♪

231
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:22,680
♪ All my doubts and fears, they disappear ♪

232
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,240
♪ So to reassure... ♪

233
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,760
Why is he still working?

234
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:35,480
♪ I'm so sure that you're my world ♪

235
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:39,240
♪ So you need to know ♪

236
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:43,600
♪ That after all the ups and downs
We've been through ♪

237
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:47,960
♪ I know it with my heart, my soul and mind ♪

238
00:17:23,120 --> 00:17:26,680
♪ I've never believed in love ♪

239
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,040
♪ I've never trusted anyone ♪

240
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:32,720
♪ I've always lived by reason ♪

241
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:37,080
♪ I've never followed my heart ♪

242
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:40,400
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

243
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:44,680
♪ But you broke through
My heavily guarded firewall ♪

244
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:48,840
♪ That used to protect my heart ♪

245
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,840
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

246
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:57,320
♪ I've just realized today that love ♪

247
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:03,360
♪ Is something I should get to know and explore ♪

248
00:18:03,360 --> 00:18:06,800
♪ The code to my heart has been cracked ♪

249
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:10,720
♪ By the love you wrapped me in ♪

250
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:13,480
♪ Having you close puts you in my dreams ♪

251
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,840
What a brat.

252
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:17,520
♪ You cracked my code ♪

253
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:20,720
♪ My heart's security system is disabled ♪

254
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,960
♪ You unlocked my heart with a love ♪

255
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:28,120
I have no problem with any of the terms
we've agreed on.

256
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,320
But before we sign,

257
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,200
I'd like to discuss the first project.

258
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:36,240
The PR campaign for our partnership.

259
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,280
I want it to be something special.

260
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:41,040
Our company, NSL, is ready to provide support.

261
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:42,760
How can we help, Roch?

262
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:43,760
No need, Nu.

263
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,320
I already have someone in mind.

264
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,160
A newcomer who just applied for a job.

265
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,320
He's very driven.

266
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,640
A newcomer?

267
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:57,000
You haven't told Nu, have you, Kit?

268
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,720
His younger brother, Nontawat,
applied for a job with me.

269
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:08,960
I should explain why I'm interested in Nont.

270
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:11,960
The kid has what it takes.

271
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,800
And he's willing to prove himself,

272
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:18,840
rather than live in his brother's shadow.

273
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:20,720
That's admirable.

274
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:25,400
I'll have Nont handle this campaign.

275
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:29,360
Once it's done, I'll hire him full-time.

276
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:35,920
Does that make you uncomfortable, Kit?

277
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,520
I'm not uncomfortable.

278
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:40,760
I just want you to know that

279
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,040
even though he's my brother,

280
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,360
you shouldn't treat him differently.

281
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,520
Don't worry, Kit.

282
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:51,160
I'll make sure to give Nont proper guidance.

283
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:54,800
Consider it a gesture of goodwill

284
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:57,120
toward building a strong partnership.

285
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:05,520
Alright, let's go over our timeline.

286
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:12,000
Let's look at Phase One, which starts next month.

287
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,760
See if you have any concerns. You too, Kit.

288
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:12,560
(Alarms: RC Capital interview, 6:00 AM)

289
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:17,480
If I disable your alarm, you won't have to go.

290
00:23:37,064 --> 00:23:40,664
I'll prove to you that I can do it on my own.

291
00:24:26,064 --> 00:24:27,144
Hello, everyone.

292
00:24:27,504 --> 00:24:33,064
Today, I'll be presenting the PR campaign
for RC Capital's new project.

293
00:24:33,744 --> 00:24:35,864
Let's start with the campaign objectives.

294
00:24:36,424 --> 00:24:38,264
There are three main objectives.

295
00:24:38,704 --> 00:24:41,784
First, to build brand credibility.

296
00:24:42,264 --> 00:24:45,784
Second, to increase investor awareness.

297
00:24:46,224 --> 00:24:50,264
And finally, to expand into
new business opportunities.

298
00:25:09,824 --> 00:25:10,784
Everyone,

299
00:25:11,144 --> 00:25:15,144
I believe PR isn't just about
convincing people to believe in us,

300
00:25:15,464 --> 00:25:19,064
but about giving them
the confidence to use our products.

301
00:25:19,744 --> 00:25:20,664
Thank you.

302
00:25:23,304 --> 00:25:24,344
Excellent.

303
00:25:41,704 --> 00:25:42,624
Come with me.

304
