308
00:26:13,424 --> 00:26:14,784
Of course I was.

309
00:26:15,344 --> 00:26:17,944
You're my brother. I'm happy to see you succeed.

310
00:26:23,184 --> 00:26:25,144
But you don't need to work here.

311
00:26:26,744 --> 00:26:28,904
I'm giving you two options.

312
00:26:28,904 --> 00:26:30,264
Go study abroad,

313
00:26:30,264 --> 00:26:32,864
or quit RC and apply somewhere else.

314
00:26:33,464 --> 00:26:34,664
I'm doing neither.

315
00:26:35,664 --> 00:26:36,544
What?

316
00:26:37,144 --> 00:26:38,384
I'm an adult.

317
00:26:39,184 --> 00:26:42,584
I'm not a kid you can control
for the rest of my life.

318
00:26:42,584 --> 00:26:45,464
I never thought you'd feel this way.

319
00:26:45,824 --> 00:26:47,544
Because you've never cared about me.

320
00:26:48,424 --> 00:26:50,624
You only care about who you want me to be.

321
00:26:51,384 --> 00:26:53,144
You have no idea what I want.

322
00:26:57,784 --> 00:27:00,184
All these years, do you know why

323
00:27:00,184 --> 00:27:02,864
I've always done everything you've asked me to?

324
00:27:03,864 --> 00:27:04,664
Why?

325
00:27:06,424 --> 00:27:08,504
Because I was afraid you wouldn't love me.

326
00:27:08,504 --> 00:27:09,984
What are you talking about?

327
00:27:09,984 --> 00:27:11,544
Why wouldn't I love you?

328
00:27:11,544 --> 00:27:12,984
You're my little brother.

329
00:27:12,984 --> 00:27:14,624
I'm your little brother.

330
00:27:14,624 --> 00:27:15,904
Exactly.

331
00:27:15,904 --> 00:27:17,944
In your eyes, I'm always a kid.

332
00:27:17,944 --> 00:27:20,344
If you can't be proud of my decision,

333
00:27:20,744 --> 00:27:23,384
then at least let me be proud of myself

334
00:27:23,384 --> 00:27:25,304
