344
00:28:40,704 --> 00:28:41,824
Of course.

345
00:28:41,824 --> 00:28:43,464
Let's start with...

346
00:28:43,464 --> 00:28:44,904
Uh, a side step.

347
00:28:46,624 --> 00:28:48,184
