- That's right.

348
00:28:48,184 --> 00:28:49,304
Left.

349
00:28:49,304 --> 00:28:50,864
Then right.

350
00:28:54,104 --> 00:28:55,704
Now move your hips, too.

351
00:28:55,704 --> 00:28:56,504
- My hips?
- Yep.

352
00:28:56,504 --> 00:28:57,464
- How?
- You have to...

353
00:28:58,464 --> 00:28:59,544
Left.

354
00:28:59,544 --> 00:29:00,384
Right.

355
00:29:06,904 --> 00:29:08,024
You're a good dancer.

356
00:29:08,424 --> 00:29:10,424
- Have you danced before?
- Nont, teach me, too.

357
00:29:10,864 --> 00:29:12,544
Uh, but you already...

358
00:29:13,144 --> 00:29:13,984
Hey.

359
00:29:13,984 --> 00:29:14,744
Uh...

360
00:29:20,624 --> 00:29:22,104
You already know how to dance.

361
00:29:22,704 --> 00:29:23,504
I forgot.

362
00:29:25,144 --> 00:29:25,984
Okay.

363
00:31:04,522 --> 00:31:05,402
Cheers.

364
00:31:06,082 --> 00:31:09,442
Here's to RC and NSL coming together.

365
00:31:09,442 --> 00:31:10,962
Come on, everyone. Cheers!

366
00:31:11,602 --> 00:31:13,562
Yay!

367
00:31:15,282 --> 00:31:19,402
Today marks the official start
of our two companies working together.

368
00:31:20,282 --> 00:31:22,642
And I'd like to raise a glass to Nont

369
00:31:22,642 --> 00:31:24,442
