379
00:31:44,642 --> 00:31:47,642
Because our company was founded on May 5th.

380
00:31:48,042 --> 00:31:49,242
Five plus five makes ten.

381
00:31:50,762 --> 00:31:51,562
Nont.

382
00:31:53,402 --> 00:31:54,642
- Come on.
- Uh...

383
00:31:55,482 --> 00:31:56,482
- Come.
- Uh...

384
00:31:57,042 --> 00:32:00,042
Good thing you didn't found
the company on October 10th.

385
00:32:00,042 --> 00:32:01,122
