390
00:32:08,042 --> 00:32:09,762
Nont, you don't have to.

391
00:32:09,762 --> 00:32:10,682
Nu's kidding.

392
00:32:11,322 --> 00:32:13,082
Kit, I'm serious.

393
00:32:15,282 --> 00:32:16,042
Nu...

394
00:32:17,442 --> 00:32:18,282
Drink, Nont.

395
00:32:19,762 --> 00:32:20,642
Drink!

396
00:32:20,642 --> 00:32:22,642
Drink! Drink!

397
00:32:22,642 --> 00:32:24,682
Drink! Drink!

398
00:32:28,082 --> 00:32:30,122
More! More!

399
00:33:56,242 --> 00:33:58,002
Nu, stop! Nu!

400
00:33:58,362 --> 00:33:59,442
Hey, Sharp!

401
00:33:59,442 --> 00:34:01,922
- No more.
- Let's do some Latin dancing.

402
00:34:01,922 --> 00:34:03,042
No more.

403
00:34:03,042 --> 00:34:05,122
- Latin dancing, you know?
- No more.

404
00:34:06,122 --> 00:34:06,882
Hey.

405
00:34:07,322 --> 00:34:08,122
No more.

406
00:34:09,762 --> 00:34:10,602
No more.

407
00:34:13,522 --> 00:34:15,282
Try this Chilean wine. It's good.

408
00:34:16,202 --> 00:34:17,202
