409
00:34:17,202 --> 00:34:18,082
Yeah.

410
00:34:20,642 --> 00:34:21,682
That's enough, Nont.

411
00:34:23,202 --> 00:34:24,322
Fine, then.

412
00:34:25,202 --> 00:34:26,522
You're so protective.

413
00:34:27,882 --> 00:34:30,242
Of course I am. He's my brother.

414
00:34:31,922 --> 00:34:32,922
Let's go home.

415
00:34:33,482 --> 00:34:35,402
Huh? Isn't this home?

416
00:34:36,282 --> 00:34:39,642
