417
00:34:39,642 --> 00:34:41,282
I had to fix it.

418
00:34:47,842 --> 00:34:48,722
Wait.

419
00:34:49,362 --> 00:34:50,242
What?

420
00:34:51,442 --> 00:34:52,402
Who are you?

421
00:34:53,042 --> 00:34:54,802
Who are you? You're so handsome.

422
00:34:55,282 --> 00:34:56,122
Hm?

423
00:34:58,882 --> 00:34:59,682
Oh!

424
00:35:00,242 --> 00:35:01,322
It's you, Kit.

425
00:35:02,362 --> 00:35:03,762
You're so handsome.

426
00:35:04,802 --> 00:35:05,842
You're wasted.

427
00:35:06,482 --> 00:35:08,202
I told you not to overdo it.

428
00:35:08,202 --> 00:35:09,082
Hey.

429
00:35:10,162 --> 00:35:11,162
I'm not drunk.

430
00:35:11,602 --> 00:35:12,962
Who's drunk? Where?

431
00:35:13,602 --> 00:35:14,562
Who's drunk?

432
00:35:15,602 --> 00:35:17,482
Watch me. I can walk straight.

433
00:35:23,562 --> 00:35:25,562
See? I'm not drunk.

434
00:35:25,882 --> 00:35:27,282
Nobody's drunk here.

435
00:35:30,602 --> 00:35:31,842
You're not drunk?

436
00:35:31,842 --> 00:35:33,682
Do you realize you almost left with Roch?

437
00:35:36,362 --> 00:35:37,242
Are you jealous?

438
00:35:38,562 --> 00:35:39,802
- You are.
- I'm not.

439
00:35:39,802 --> 00:35:40,802
- You are.
- I'm not.

440
00:35:40,802 --> 00:35:42,042
- You are.
- I'm not.

441
00:35:42,042 --> 00:35:42,842
You are!

442
00:35:42,842 --> 00:35:43,682
I'm just worried.

443
00:35:43,682 --> 00:35:44,882
This guy's jealous!

444
00:35:44,882 --> 00:35:46,602
This guy's jealous, everyone!

445
00:35:46,602 --> 00:35:48,002
This guy's jealous!

446
00:35:48,002 --> 00:35:49,402
- Let's go.
- This guy's jealous!

447
00:35:49,402 --> 00:35:50,202
Come on.

448
00:35:50,202 --> 00:35:51,442
This guy's jealous!

449
00:35:51,442 --> 00:35:52,402
Nont.

450
00:35:52,402 --> 00:35:53,242
What?

451
00:35:54,642 --> 00:35:55,482
Oh.

452
00:35:56,882 --> 00:35:57,802
Ugh.

453
00:36:00,762 --> 00:36:01,962
Can you make it down?

454
00:36:01,962 --> 00:36:03,002
Yeah. Wait!

455
00:36:03,562 --> 00:36:05,882
No, I can't. You'll have to carry me.

456
00:36:06,682 --> 00:36:08,442
We'll both fall down if I do that.

457
00:36:08,442 --> 00:36:10,682
- One, two, three.
- One, two, three.

458
00:36:11,682 --> 00:36:14,642
Hey, I haven't walked yet. I'm floating.

459
00:36:14,642 --> 00:36:16,442
- I have to walk.
- Don't walk.

460
00:36:16,442 --> 00:36:18,082
Are we home yet? Can I sleep here?

461
00:36:18,082 --> 00:36:19,082
Don't sleep, Nont.

462
00:36:19,082 --> 00:36:22,602
All you do is tell me no. Don't walk,
don't sleep, don't do this or that.

463
00:36:22,602 --> 00:36:23,762
Can I kiss your cheek?

464
00:36:23,762 --> 00:36:25,482
"Don't kiss me!" Right?

465
00:36:25,482 --> 00:36:28,442
You keep telling me no.
You're really good at that.

466
00:36:29,322 --> 00:36:32,682
♪ I've never trusted anyone ♪

467
00:36:32,682 --> 00:36:35,362
♪ I've always lived by reason ♪

468
00:36:35,362 --> 00:36:39,682
♪ I've never followed my heart ♪

469
00:36:39,682 --> 00:36:42,962
♪ Locked away with a complicated code ♪

470
00:36:42,962 --> 00:36:47,322
♪ But you broke through
My heavily guarded firewall ♪

471
00:36:47,322 --> 00:36:50,162
