472
00:36:50,162 --> 00:36:51,482
Where are you going?

473
00:36:52,642 --> 00:36:53,802
Where are you going?

474
00:36:53,802 --> 00:36:54,722
Home.

475
00:36:55,642 --> 00:36:56,722
Home's this way.

476
00:36:58,242 --> 00:36:59,042
Oh.

477
00:37:00,602 --> 00:37:01,402
Mm.

478
00:37:02,202 --> 00:37:03,002
Carry me.

479
00:37:03,322 --> 00:37:04,282
You can walk.

480
00:37:05,802 --> 00:37:07,362
My legs are weak.

481
