You were dancing earlier.

482
00:37:11,202 --> 00:37:13,562
I danced too much, so my legs are weak.

483
00:37:14,962 --> 00:37:16,642
I have no energy left.

484
00:37:18,642 --> 00:37:20,082
Carry me.

485
00:37:20,562 --> 00:37:21,442
Please?

486
00:37:22,082 --> 00:37:23,242
I said, carry me!

487
00:37:24,202 --> 00:37:26,082
Carry me. Carry me. Carry me. Carry me.

488
00:37:26,082 --> 00:37:27,762
Carry me. Carry me. Carry me.

489
00:37:32,282 --> 00:37:34,882
Wow, Kit. You're so strong.

490
00:37:35,922 --> 00:37:36,922
Stop squirming.

491
00:37:39,042 --> 00:37:41,882
Wow, and you smell so good.

492
00:37:43,482 --> 00:37:44,722
Hey.

493
00:37:44,722 --> 00:37:47,042
Your heart's beating so fast.

494
00:37:47,402 --> 00:37:50,522
I finally made your heart race, Kit.

495
00:37:50,522 --> 00:37:51,482
Yay!

496
00:37:51,962 --> 00:37:53,642
I told you not to overdo it.

497
00:37:53,642 --> 00:37:55,282
But I was having fun.

498
00:37:55,282 --> 00:37:56,882
Now you can't even walk.

499
00:37:56,882 --> 00:37:57,842
Whoa, hey.

500
00:37:57,842 --> 00:37:58,962
Where are we going?

501
00:37:58,962 --> 00:38:00,162
To your room.

502
00:38:00,162 --> 00:38:01,442
No.

503
00:38:01,962 --> 00:38:03,162
I said no.

504
00:38:03,162 --> 00:38:04,842
- Hey.
- No.

505
00:38:04,842 --> 00:38:06,642
I'm going with you, Kit.

506
00:38:06,642 --> 00:38:08,402
What? Get in your room.

507
00:38:08,402 --> 00:38:09,322
No.

508
00:38:09,322 --> 00:38:12,202
Kit, no. I wanna sleep with you.

509
00:38:12,202 --> 00:38:13,322
Don't be stubborn.

510
00:38:13,322 --> 00:38:14,202
No!

511
00:38:15,602 --> 00:38:17,122
I wanna sleep with you.

512
00:38:20,602 --> 00:38:22,282
Come on, let's go to bed.

513
00:38:22,722 --> 00:38:23,522
Let's go.

514
00:38:24,522 --> 00:38:25,402
Let's go.

515
00:38:26,602 --> 00:38:27,482
Let's go.

516
00:38:36,522 --> 00:38:38,242
Mm, let's go to bed.

517
00:38:45,242 --> 00:38:46,362
Nont, let go.

518
00:38:48,602 --> 00:38:49,802
No way.

519
00:38:50,962 --> 00:38:52,522
I'm getting you some water.

520
00:38:53,362 --> 00:38:54,242
Liar.

521
00:38:55,282 --> 00:38:57,202
I know you'll sleep somewhere else.

522
00:38:58,162 --> 00:39:00,282
Why don't you wanna sleep with me?

523
00:39:08,402 --> 00:39:10,362
Why are you like this when you're drunk?

524
00:39:11,042 --> 00:39:12,562
It's because of you.

525
00:39:12,562 --> 00:39:15,442
You're trying to send me away to another country.

526
00:39:17,682 --> 00:39:20,562
Did you ever ask if I wanted to go?

527
00:39:24,842 --> 00:39:26,402
I don't want to go.

528
00:39:27,322 --> 00:39:28,922
I want to stay with you.

529
00:39:47,442 --> 00:39:48,642
Can you feel it?

530
00:39:51,162 --> 00:39:53,362
My heart beats this fast

531
00:39:53,362 --> 00:39:54,762
