532
00:40:02,682 --> 00:40:04,922
You know how I feel, don't you?

533
00:40:07,042 --> 00:40:08,042
You're drunk.

534
00:40:10,002 --> 00:40:10,962
Yes, I am.

535
00:41:42,052 --> 00:41:42,932
You're drunk.

536
00:41:43,372 --> 00:41:44,532
We'll talk tomorrow.

537
00:41:47,332 --> 00:41:48,692
If we wait until tomorrow,

538
00:41:49,292 --> 00:41:51,252
I won't have the courage to say it.

539
00:42:02,172 --> 00:42:03,892
If you don't feel the same way,

540
00:42:05,412 --> 00:42:06,452
I'll stop.

541
00:43:07,172 --> 00:43:09,132
See? You feel it, too.

542
00:43:13,092 --> 00:43:14,732
Nont, I...

543
00:43:16,092 --> 00:43:17,692
You don't have to say anything.

544
00:43:20,052 --> 00:43:21,212
