556
00:47:49,252 --> 00:47:50,772
What is this feeling?

557
00:47:56,692 --> 00:47:57,852
You don't remember?

558
00:47:58,292 --> 00:48:00,492
So I told him I didn't remember.

559
00:48:00,492 --> 00:48:01,652
What did he say?

560
00:48:01,652 --> 00:48:02,932
He said, "Good."

561
00:48:02,932 --> 00:48:04,772
I don't know what's wrong with him.

562
00:48:04,772 --> 00:48:08,012
We pass each other at home,
and he treats me like a stranger, Sharp.

563
00:48:08,012 --> 00:48:08,852
Shit.

564
00:48:10,332 --> 00:48:10,972
(I love you, my sweet boy)

565
00:48:10,972 --> 00:48:11,932
"Love"?

566
00:48:15,452 --> 00:48:17,692
What about you? Are you in love with someone

567
00:48:17,692 --> 00:48:20,252
you've waited for so long,
but who's never noticed you?

568
00:48:20,252 --> 00:48:21,012
Good night.

569
00:48:22,052 --> 00:48:24,532
How I feel is my business, not yours.

570
00:48:24,532 --> 00:48:25,492
Exactly.

571
00:48:25,492 --> 00:48:28,052
I'm tired of you never being honest with me.

572
00:48:28,052 --> 00:48:31,852
♪ When closeness starts to stir up feelings ♪

573
00:48:31,852 --> 00:48:39,052
♪ And my heart starts to get carried away ♪

574
00:48:39,052 --> 00:48:42,772
♪ As our bond begins to change ♪

575
00:48:42,772 --> 00:48:44,812
♪ Every time I look at you ♪

576
00:48:44,812 --> 00:48:47,172
♪ My heart ♪

577
00:48:47,732 --> 00:48:51,132
♪ Flutters more than I can bear ♪

578
00:48:51,532 --> 00:48:54,212
♪ Before I knew it ♪

579
00:48:54,212 --> 00:48:56,932
♪ Before I realized how I felt ♪

580
00:48:56,932 --> 00:49:00,252
♪ I couldn't stop it anymore ♪

581
00:49:00,252 --> 00:49:03,492
♪ It's too late now ♪

582
00:49:03,492 --> 00:49:09,132
♪ I'm already yours ♪

583
00:49:11,092 --> 00:49:14,452
♪ Somehow I gave my heart to you ♪

584
00:49:14,772 --> 00:49:20,372
♪ I don't even know when it happened ♪

585
00:49:21,852 --> 00:49:25,172
♪ Someone who's always here ♪

586
00:49:25,172 --> 00:49:30,132
♪ Someone you know so well ♪

587
00:49:30,612 --> 00:49:36,052
♪ There's something I've been waiting to say ♪

588
00:49:36,052 --> 00:49:41,492
♪ But I don't know how to say it ♪

589
00:49:43,732 --> 00:49:47,412
♪ Being by your side like this ♪

590
00:49:47,412 --> 00:49:51,532
♪ Makes me feel so good that I still... ♪
